Subject: [PATCH 079/119] qca-nss-ecm-support-CORE

Imported from https://github.com/kuncy7/openwrt-nss-edma target/linux/qualcommax/patches-6.18/0960-qca-nss-ecm-support-CORE.patch (added in be0fb2aa69); the patch file carries no author or description.
